  "details": "Avatar stealing has been a problem for VRChat for as long as I can remember. Rippers have existed to steal peoples avatar, and easily reupload them with very minor edits and call it there own. VRChat should implement some level of encryption on avatar ID's to make copying them  a lot harder. Although I know that people who rip avatars could eventually figure out the encryption it would at the least slow them down for a bit.",
